      "writtenOn": "2023-08-23T15:53:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Runtime exceptions are unchecked, they are not declared in methods signature. The rationale is that since this is a debugging-related functionality, any problems encountered during its execution must not cause an exception to be propagated further because this will likely result in a termination of the system service which will look like a \"soft restart\" to users.",
